# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Maps opened from the home screen and left 70 s (its map is VectorKit's, drawn with Metal in the application), the
# sheet dragged down 40 s in to show more of the map -- for screenshots from the host (devices/akita TODO 18c).
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 20
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.615 0.60 wait 40 swipe 0.5 0.55 0.5 0.9 300 wait 30 button home wait 3
